---
// For Guides Section
---

<section id="for-guides" class="for-guides section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Built for birding guides in Algarve.</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">
      FollowBirds helps professional guides prepare tours, share live sightings with participants and create beautiful reports clients can keep forever.
    </p>

    <div class="features">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">📋</div>
        <h3>Tour templates</h3>
        <p>Create reusable tour plans and prepare locations, species lists, and expected sightings.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">👥</div>
        <h3>Participant invitations</h3>
        <p>Invite participants through direct link, QR code, or email and manage your tour group.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">✓</div>
        <h3>Live shared checklists</h3>
        <p>Record observations once. Participants see the shared species list immediately and mark their own sightings.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">📸</div>
        <h3>Observation timeline</h3>
        <p>Capture species, photos, notes, time and location for every sighting during the tour.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">📄</div>
        <h3>Automatic reports</h3>
        <p>After each tour, generate professional web and PDF reports your clients can keep forever.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">👤</div>
        <h3>Guide profile</h3>
        <p>Build your professional profile and track guide analytics as we develop them.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="for-guides-cta">
      <a href="#guide-program" class="btn btn-primary">Join the Guide Program</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .for-guides {
    background-color: #faf9f7;
  }

  .for-guides h2 {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    background: #fff;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
  }

  .feature-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    color: #1b5e20;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .feature-card p {
    color: #666;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .for-guides-cta {
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .features {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
